  "llm_cache": "data/raw/llm/olmo_gguf/additional_assets__v4.json",
  "status": "prose",
  "value": "Code, checkpoints and training details are released (logs coming soon). Repositories: Open-Instruct (DPO and RLVR) at https://github.com/allenai/open-instruct; OLMo-Core (pre-training and SFT) at https://github.com/allenai/OLMo-core; OLMo-Eval (evaluation) at https://github.com/allenai/OLMo-Eval. Checkpoints are accessible via the HuggingFace `revision` argument (naming `step_XXXX`). Datasets include Dolci-Instruct-SFT-7B, Dolci-Instruct-DPO-7B and Dolci-Instruct-RL-7B on Hugging Face.",
  "quote": "We are releasing all code, checkpoints, logs (coming soon), and associated training details. [...] - Open-Instruct for DPO and RLVR: https://github.com/allenai/open-instruct [...] - OLMo-Core for pre-training and SFT: https://github.com/allenai/OLMo-core [...] - OLMo-Eval for evaluation: https://github.com/allenai/OLMo-Eval [...] We have released checkpoints for these models. For post-training, the naming convention is `step_XXXX`. [...] To load a specific model revision with HuggingFace, simply add the argument `revision`: [...] - Datasets: [Dolci-Think-RL-7B](https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/Dolci-Think-RL-7B), [Dolci-Instruct-RL-7B](https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/Dolci-Instruct-RL-7B)",
  "quotes": [
   "We are releasing all code, checkpoints, logs (coming soon), and associated training details.",
   "- Open-Instruct for DPO and RLVR: https://github.com/allenai/open-instruct",
   "- OLMo-Core for pre-training and SFT: https://github.com/allenai/OLMo-core",
   "- OLMo-Eval for evaluation: https://github.com/allenai/OLMo-Eval",
   "We have released checkpoints for these models. For post-training, the naming convention is `step_XXXX`.",
   "To load a specific model revision with HuggingFace, simply add the argument `revision`:",
   "- Datasets: [Dolci-Think-RL-7B](https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/Dolci-Think-RL-7B), [Dolci-Instruct-RL-7B](https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/Dolci-Instruct-RL-7B)"
  ],
